When not in a unicode locale and -J is enabled, concurrent-output is not
used. This can lead to some display glitches. For example, with 
`LANG=C git-annex copy --to foo -J2`, it will sometimes output

    ok
    ok

And sometimes

    (to foo...) (to foo...)

The fix for this will probably be to prevent more than 1 job when
in such a locale. --[[Joey]]
